Mac OS X finally has a native window port (nethack-cocoa) of vanilla
NetHack 3.4.3.

Get your binary (and of course sources if you prefer) here:
http://code.google.com/p/nethack-cocoa/

More information:
http://blog.dirkz.com/2010/03/nethack-343-ported-to-mac-os-x-cocoa.html

